    | translation app | 翻譯 App | This translation app helps me learn new words. |           
    | help me learn | 幫助我學習 | Reading every day helps me learn English. |                
                                                                                              
    ## 5. Useful Sentence Pattern                                                             
                                                                                              
    **Pattern:**                                                                              
